  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "工程資訊管理導論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO ENGINEERING INFORMATION MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程之主要內容乃根基於營建業之產業特性，介紹資訊系統於營建管理層面之基本應用與關聯。此外，並從新經濟環境適應的理論和實務面，簡介網際網路、電子商務、與知識管理於產業之發展與機會，提供工程背景學生資訊管理之基本知識與進階學習之導引。",
    "describe_eh": "Based on construction industry viewpoint, this course provides an introduction to management information systems that undergraduate students will find vital to their professional abilities. Major topics include c-CALS, Internet application, e-commerce, knowledge management and database management systems.",
